    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n49083" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θρέομαι</span></b> , only in pres., <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>cry aloud, shriek</i>, always of
			women, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θρέομαι φοβερὰ μεγάλ᾽ ἄχη</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.
					<u>Th.</u>
					78
				</span></i>
			; elsewh. only in part., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μινυρὰ θρεομένας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Ag.</u>
					1165
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πάθεα μέλεα θρεομένα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Supp.</u>
					112
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Hipp.</u>
				363
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αὐτὴ θρεομένη σαυτῇ κακά</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Med.</u>
					51
				</span></i>
			 (trim., elsewh. lyr.).—
				Act.
			 only in <i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i> (I.-<i><span class="en">
				E.
			</span></i>
			<i>dhreu-</i>, cf. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θρο-έω,
			θρῦ-λος</span>.)</div>
